k_id":"Q+r2o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fac4a4c-e5ba-4cb8-8213-511119c8afc7","type":"message","user":"U0238G3KV8D","text":"共有ありがとうございます\n説明会受けて参加できそうだったら開業だ","ts":"1636103756.331400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"teUFb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0B1A6918-9A74-49C7-9305-38186B4574DD","type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"給与所得と事業所得で別の控除が用意されてるっぽいですけど、両方の所得がある場合って各所得ごとに控除適用できるんですかね","ts":"1636103578.329700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OxH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89EC244C-88A7-4D5D-902E-D14EEB45D1CB","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"来年の申告終わったら一年は経費気にしなくていい暮らしするぞー","ts":"1636091502.325300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R37N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B0B8395F-77D6-4A98-8D43-3F81CD7AFB48","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"今年一旦個人事業主廃業したんで","ts":"1636091463.324100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"reO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecff42f7-394d-49d5-85d2-04d1f64fe4ca","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"青色申告はマネーフォワード試してみる感じになりそう","ts":"1636089895.323100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SuHR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11a8d37d-b9a1-4b26-b53c-e8277a2416c7","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"社保に関してはやっぱり加入している組合の方をあたるしかなさそうですね\n税金控除の方は帳簿のつけ方と申告方法で変わってくるのか","ts":"1636089794.322500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RMU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a630b44f-9c69-4621-8aba-d141911d4e21","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"おかねむつかしー","ts":"1636089583.321500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZnJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c789e913-3d44-4074-9bab-aeee98f06af1","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"顧問税理士さんから回答がきたので共有しておきますね。\n\n\u0026gt; Q1. 12月からの業務開始で、最初の請求が12月末付2月末払いだとした場合、確定申告の収入としては令和4年分に含まれますか？それとも令和3年分になりますか？\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; A1. 令和3年分の収入となります。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; Q2. 扶養家族の人（主に学生さん）が青色申告する場合「年間収入 − 青色申告特別控除65万 − 経費」が103万を超えなれば大丈夫でしょうか？また、扶養者の社保から外れる基準も念のため確認しておきたいです。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; A2. 103万円というのは収入が給与収入の場合のラインでして、給与収入の場合給与所得控除55万円+基礎控除48万円=103万円となります。貴社の業務委託の場合は事業収入となりますので、下記の計算となります。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; 年間収入ー経費ー（10万円or65万円）ー基礎控除48万円ーその他医療費控除等の各種控除=0であれば扶養からは外れません。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; (65万円控除が受けられる条件は下記となります。）\n\u0026gt; \u003chttps://www.nta.go.jp/taxes/shiraberu/taxanswer/shotoku/2072.htm\u003e\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; また社会保険の扶養に関しては基本的には収入が130万円以上になると扶養から外れてしまいます。\n\u0026gt; ここでいう収入について、事業収入の場合は収入から経費を引いた金額で判断するか収入のみで判断するかは、加入している社会保険組合によって変わるようです。ただ先ほどの（10万円or65万円）については所得税法上の控除ですので、社会保険の扶養の判定には使用できません。\n","ts":"1636089414.320900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"otxu","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]},{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U02269AAADD"]},{"name":"kan","count":1,"users":["U0238G3KV8D"]},{"name":"sha","count":2,"users":["U0238G3KV8D","U02269AAADD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NKLN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"325E680C-9100-4AD0-852E-A4B0DA49958D","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"いいかい、学生さん、学生のうちにカードは作っておかないと社会人になってからだとメンドイぞ","ts":"1636089407.320700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pp0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"679fca32-cd69-4bff-af1e-4ee009643f23","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"種銭がない","ts":"1636082885.317700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lqjO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"528096a4-0a25-4bb4-a188-b712938d9e17","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"よく考えたら最初の一月は経費一切使えないという事に思い至り","ts":"1636082854.317200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Goqb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3465ca3-387b-4063-8bb5-156953ebb0bd","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"扶養は仮に外れてもどうせ23年就職なので気にせんでもええやろ的な精神でいけますが、社保が外れると結構めんどくさい","ts":"1636081710.315500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"STT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d27912c1-e320-4970-b5e3-b3b6e5390d57","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"事務はめんどい。わかる。","ts":"1636081565.314900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"agM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"45e017f5-66cb-4b79-a86f-9dd6c3ff4795","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"う~ん迷うけど正直その扶養周りが面倒臭そうなのがなぁ","ts":"1636081421.314700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hCZ0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1109432b-8e29-4b49-a29c-8109a84033a3","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"1月からの参加もありですよ!","ts":"1636079390.313700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/7L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61179f95-18de-486b-91fc-e41cf4abadec","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ずっと迷ってるけどうーん・・・","ts":"1636079361.313300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lUGnA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3d4ab18-d5c2-4c16-add9-d3cdb950d0d8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"業務委託契約書等のドラフト共有完了。\nあとは説明会の日程を決めて準備しよう。","ts":"1636079343.312900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i5W9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48c1ca01-2dd2-45f5-8ac9-11c17fada62b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"NDAは何度かバイトとかで結んでるので要点は掴みやすかった","ts":"1636076050.311100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reaction